  "notes": "Item 19 discloses financial performance data for franchisee-owned SpeeDee Centers for Fiscal Year 2025. Chart I presents data for 45 franchisee-owned Centers classified into five sales-range categories (A\u2013E). Chart II presents the same 45 Centers reclassified into four quartiles (Top, Third, Second, Bottom) but only reports Net Sales and Gross Profit averages (no EBITDAR or operating expense detail for Chart II). All centers were in operation for more than one year as of December 31, 2025, operated the entire calendar year 2025, and provided complete P&L statements. Data excludes co-branded centers and affiliate-owned (GMI) centers. EBITDAR excludes occupancy costs, interest, taxes, depreciation, amortization, and non-operating items. Note: Chart I Category A has only 2 centers, so its medians equal the averages (consistent with a 2-center group midpoint). The cohort_name 'performance_anchored' is used for all sales-range and quartile segments since they are defined by sales performance thresholds. Cost of Goods Sold dollar values are available for Chart I (embedded in Gross Profit derivation) and Chart II average only; Low/Median/High performer breakouts for COGS are not disclosed in Chart II."
}